[["heading","SECTION 24 / PRACTICAL PROJECT\nGitHub collaboration — practice\nchecklist"],["text","Use a separate practice GitHub repo if you want to repeat the project with a real pull request. The\nlocal bare-repo simulation does not create a PR."],["heading","Task\nExpected result"],["text","Clone / initialize practice repo\nmain branch with README"],["text","Create feature/login\nSeparate named ref"],["text","Make one focused commit\nDiff contains only login work"],["text","Push feature branch\nRemote feature ref exists"],["text","Open PR to main on GitHub\nReviewable changes and test notes"],["text","Review, check CI, merge\nmain includes feature"],["text","Fetch / pull after merge\nLocal branch is up to date"],["heading","Interview rehearsal"],["text","Explain: what problem did the branch solve? How did you review changes? How would you handle a\nconflict? What would you do if a secret was committed?"],["sinhala","","තමන් ඇතේතටම project එJකේ භාවිත කළ Git workflow එක පමණකේ experience විදිහට කියන්න. Jම්",498],["sinhala","","project එක learning simulation එකකේ.",194]]